In the defense Ministry reported on the successful completion of tests of a hypersonic missile “Zircon”
In the Ministry of defense of the Russian Federation reported on the successful completion of tests of the hypersonic missile “Zircon”.
On the Day of the Naval Fleet, the defense Ministry noted that the test launches carried out from the frigate “Admiral of the Fleet of the Soviet Union Gorshkov” confirmed the unique tactical and technical characteristics of this missile on the range and accuracy of firing, as well as the hypersonic velocity of its flight.
According to the Ministry of Defense, conducting tests of a hypersonic missile is planned.
Earlier in May, the Deputy Minister of Defense Alexei Krivoruchko reported that the naval complex with the latest hypersonic Zircon missile will go into service in 2021 - 2022.
Became known clubs claiming the star of “Lokomotiv” Miranchuk, and his salary in Italy.
According to “SE”, at the moment the midfielder of “Lokomotiv” Alexei Miranchuk is claimed by the teams A “Milan”, “Lazio”, “Fiorentina” and “Atalant”.
24-year-on-edvideo would like to receive a contract for four years with a salary of at least 2 million euros a year with bonuses.
Any club that makes such an offer will receive a priority.
Lokomotiv firmly intends to sell its main star and make money on it.
In other cases, the club is waiting for serious spending on the renewal of the contract with a midfielder.
