Together with "Locomotive", the midfielder became the champion of Russia (2017/18), three times won the country's Cup (2014/15, 2016/17, 2018/19) and once the Super Cup of Russia (2019).
The United States urged Qatar and its neighbors to stop the dispute
It is Necessary Necessary to restore trust and unity between Qatar and other states, according to U.S. Special Envoy for Iran Brian Hook.
He declared that the conflict between the emirate and other countries of the region has been going too long and is detrimental to regional interests in the field of stability, prosperity and security.
Until now, the U.S. has unsuccessfully tried to act as a conciliator in settling the dispute, which Washington sees as “threat of efforts to contain Iran.”
Diplocographic relations with Qatar three years ago plundered the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Egypt and Bahrain.
They imposed a transport blockade, accusing Qatar of supporting terrorism.
In response, Doha said that the neighbors simply envied the economic success of Qatar - according to the IMF, for several years with a large tich leader in GDP per capita.
The emirate is the third in terms of natural gas reserves, the sixth exporter of natural gas and a large exporter of oil and petroleum products.
