In Stavropol warned about a new scheme of credit Internet scaffillation
The administration of Stavropol warned about a new scheme of credit Internet fraud.
Over the past six months in the region recorded 4 thousand scamps, made remotely.
One of the popular methods of deceiving is the registration of loans on dubious sites.
An intrudder places false information about obtaining a loan on favorable terms, and after a response, calls the applicant and says that it is Necessary to transfer a commission, a fee or an advance payment.
When the user complises the conditions, the crook ceases to get in touch.
Citizens are reminded that it is impossible not to leave their personal and banking data on unverified sites.
In Viet Nam in an accident with a bus killed at least 13 people
At least 13 people were killed in an accident involving a shuttle in Quangbin province in central Vietnam.
About it reports the newspaper “Tuoyche”.
According to the publication of the publication, the vehicle overturned into a ditch.
At least 39 people were on the bus at that moment, they were on their way to a graduating meeting.
As a result, 13 people were killed, dozens of victims were hospitalized.
The causes of the accident have not yet been specified.
