On Saturday at an emergency meeting, the leadership of the country discussed the current situation, and the head of the state Kim Jong-un announced his readiness to take maximum measures of protection from the spread of COVID-19.
According to official data, in the DPRK at the moment there is not a single confirmed case of infection.
