The Pope Francis welcomed the adoption of the dot-term and the agreement of the contact group on the settlement of the conflict in the Donbas.
I am pleased to learn about the achievement of the agreement in the Donbass, another step in the name of reconciliation on this long-suffering land, the pontiff said during a traditional Sunday sermon on St. Peter’s Square.
