Russian "Proton" is ready to conquer the expanses
The Proton-M missile is ready for launch, during which it will put into orbit two telecommunications satellites of the Ex-Speak series.
This conclusion was concluded by the State Commission.
Already on July 26 the device will be displayed on the launch pad of the Baikonur cosmodrome.
Immediate launch of the rocket is planned for July 30.
The initial launch date was shifted after a series of malformations were detected among the components of a carrier rocket.
According to Roscosmos, the defective parts were manufactured at the Ust-Katava plant in Chelyabinsk in 2015-2016.
