The Russian refused to pay for the parking lot and beat the worker of the Parking
In Vladivostok, the man refused to pay the parking lot and stabbed a parking worker, the police are conducting an inspection.
About it reports portal vl.ru with reference to the press service of the Ministry of internal Affairs of Russia in the city.
the incident occurred on Friday, July 24, in the parking lot near the shopping center.
