Possation: The ruling Union of Peasants and “Lutried” Lithuania again headed the rating of the parties
The Union of Peasants and "Green" of Lithuania, which heads the ruling sejia coalition, topped the rating of parties.
This was shown by a survey conducted by the sociological research company Vilmorus until ordering the newspaper Lietuvos rytas.
After the victory in the parliamentary elections of in the year of the year of the year in 2016, the “peasants” lost the first place and for a long time led the main critic of Russia in Lithuania, the opposition “Union of the Father of the fatherland – Christian  Democrats (Conservatives).
