Myasnikov urged everyone to pay attention to these factors.
And, according to him, to control the waist is even more important than the weight.
For men, this parameter should not exceed 102 centimeters, for women - 88 centimeters.
Exceeding these norms may indicate that health is in jeopardy.
First of all, we are talking about the state of the heart - waist above the norm is a risk factor for a stroke, infarction, as well as cancer and diabation.
We will remind, earlier Myasnikov told why you can eat candy at the last night.
The doctor explained that the sugar in itself is not dangerous for health, harmful desserts will become only when there is such food in large quantities, and the candid thing at night, according to him, is not the worst snust.
