In Irkutsk the plane made an emergency landing
In Irkutsk, a plane en route to the Moscow-Ulan-Ude, made an emergency landing due to a smoking passenger.
According to RIA Novosti, the incident occurred on Sunday night.
The aircraft stayed at Irkutsk airport for 25 minutes while the man who posed a threat to the flight security was transferred to the police.
