In Krasnodar will organize "round tables" with the developers of the General plan of the city
Meetings with the creators of the General Plan will be held in the format of a "round table" in all interior districts of Krasnodar.
Events will start on July 27.
The meetings will involve public figures and the developers of the project, according to the administration of the regional capital.
Schedule "round tables": July 27 at 18:30 - in the Karasunsky district at Selezneva street, 244; July 28 at 18:30 - in the Central district of Stavropolskaya street, 77; on July 29 at 18:30 in the Western district at Kalinina street, 339; on July 30 - in Prikubansky district at the street Atarbe
Debation of the General plan will take place in several stages.
Each citizen can make their own proposals and wishes, for example, filling out a special form on the portal of public discussions of Krasnodar.
You can send your request via e-mail: str@krd.ru, as well as an ordinary letter at: 350000, Krasnodar, Krasnaya street, 122.
The woman threw the body of her husband into a pit and poured with concrete near Belgorod
In the Belgorod region the woman confessed to the murder of her own husband, whom she dumped in a pit with waste and poured concrete, according to the website of the regional administration of the Investigative Committee of the Russian Federation.
It is noted that the suspect lived in a marriage with those killed since 1999.
In recent years, the husband began to abrupt alcohol and after another quarrel the woman decided to kill.
“When the husband slept, the suspect tied his hands and his feet, put a plastic bag on his toe with a pillow.
When the husband ceased to show signs of life, wrapped the body in a carpet, carried it into the trunk and hid in the cesspool.
The next day she summoned a concrete mixer and filled the yoke with concrete," the management said.
Later, the woman reported that her husband was missing.
Relatives of the deceased appealed to the police, who opened the pit and removed the body.
The investigation intends to ask the court about the arrest of the suspect.
Investigation of the criminal case is currently ongoing.
