Singer Polina Gagarina called helping to lose weight products
Russian singer Polina Gagarina called five products that helped her to adjust the figure and subsequently do not gain weight again.
The first in the list was the water.
The singer prefers to drink pure unsagged water before every medve every meal to dull the feeling of stalking and eating less.
Vegetable salad, brown rhinestone and seafood are ideal for maintaining slender.
Thanks to them, you can make a balanced diet: vegetables contain fiber, there are complex carbohydrates in rice, and sea products are a source of protein, useful vitamins and amino acids.
For unloading days, the singer chooses apples.
Thanks to these products, Gagarina was able to get rid of 30 extra kilograms.
In addition, the singer switched to a fractional meatheth - she eats a little and a little and excluded fatty, sweet and caloric from the diet.
Gagarina does not eat fried food, breeze, sausages and other meat semi-finished products, writes kp.ru on July 6.
It also replaced red-fascinated red meat with fish and seafood.
Prefers vegetables (other than potatoes), whole-grain cereals and a lot of garlic.
Gagarin is also actively engaged in the gym, yoga and running.
Earlier, the Russian singer Sergey Lazarev told how he was able to retrieve during the period of self-isolation excess weight.
According to the artist, he adjusted the meals and was actively engaged in running.
